  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Family Ethereal</strong></p><p><strong>Anima Weapon </strong>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.spells.Item.uImZYfIXFrd2GFHp]{Anima Weapon: Phantom Flourish}</p><p><strong>Anima Morph </strong>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.spells.Y0QHQGdkE6rz1xZl]{Anima Morph: Phantom Flourish}</p><p><strong>Anima Ability</strong> @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.spells.Item.rkE6BeClIyE6vP5u]{Anima Ability: Phantom Flourish}</p><hr><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You rapidly shift between the material and ethereal planes as you launch forward to a target to strike. You Teleport up to your speed and make an Anima Strike at a creature. On a hit, a creature takes 2d6 additional spirit damage from the attack.</p><p>This attack has the Flourish trait.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Heightened (4th) </strong>You deal 3d6 additional spirit damage, and you regain half the amount of this damage you deal as temporary hit points.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Heightened (6th) </strong>As 4th, but you also Teleport up to twice your speed.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> As 6th, but you deal 4d6 additional spirit damage instead.</p>"
